# The sum on two islands of two workers: x is a row of 8 tiles holding 1 to 8.
# Look for: part, the same four parts (3, 7, 11, 15) on both copies after the gather; y, 36 in every worker's tile.
options workers 4 islands 2,2
tensor x f32 4 32 fill tile+1
tensor part f32 4 16 replicated
tensor y f32 4 16
control census x part y 8:u32
read part
read y
